one step further this one will decrease and you will have the reward for the next state that

290
00:23:52,900 --> 00:23:56,580
picked the next action and then the reward for the next state that picked the next action and so

291
00:23:56,580 --> 00:24:03,700
on and so on. And what we're trying to find is to maximize this sum of infinite possibilities

292
00:24:03,700 --> 00:24:08,500
you'll have and find the best trajectory through all the states and actions you could take

293
00:24:08,500 --> 00:24:15,940
that give you the maximum cumulative reward. That is impossible to compute because it's an

294
00:24:15,940 --> 00:24:23,539
