297
00:24:43,700 --> 00:24:51,299
the maximum score you could have to pick any of the actions you have because you are inside of one

298
00:24:51,299 --> 00:25:00,740
state. So that's your immediate reward plus the discounting factor of the next state that already

299
00:25:00,740 --> 00:25:08,019
knows what is the best action reward you can have. So it is an iterative process. Basically,

